"an RTL-SDR V3 (or compatible) with a powered LNA, active\n"
"antenna, or bias-T powered filter.\n"
"\n"
"Enable Bias Tee?"
msgstr ""
"Le Bias Tee fournit une tension continue de 4,5 V via le connecteur "
